# ============================================================
#  最小对账实验：2×2 轴网、1 层、一片沿 X 的墙
#  顶层水平力 +Y 100 kN/节点（顶层 4 节点 → 总 400 kN）
#  验证：第 1 层层剪力（柱+墙）应 = 基底水平反力矢量和
# ============================================================
material C30    concrete 30
section  COL    rect 0.5 0.5
section  BM     rect 0.3 0.6

grid.axisX   0 6
grid.axisY   0 6
grid.story   0 3.6
grid.column  COL C30
grid.beam    BM  C30
grid.slabthick 0.12
grid.slab    off
grid.wallthick 0.25
grid.wallx   0 0
grid.wally   0 0

support base fixed

nodeload top 0 100 0

out mini_wall